# Client Architecture (SoC)

## Layers (one job each)

| Layer | Folder | Allowed to do | Must NOT do |
|---|---|---|---|
| App shell | `app/` | Providers, router, root composition | Domain fetch/business rules |
| Pages | `pages/` | Compose features/layout for a route | Own network/socket orchestration |
| Features | `features/*` | Domain hooks + feature UI wiring | Generic design-system widgets |
| Components | `components/` | Presentational UI | Call APIs or Zustand for server data |
| API | `api/` | `fetch` helpers + resource functions | Touch React / Zustand |
| Stores | `stores/` | Client/UI session state (auth flags, badges) | Call the network |
| Socket | `socket/` | Connect/lifecycle; thin emit/listen | Fat domain logic |
| Types | `types/` | Shared TS types only | Runtime logic |
| Validators | `validators/` | Zod schemas only | Side effects |
| Utils / lib | `utils/`, `lib/` | Pure helpers / constants | Feature orchestration |

## Naming

Folder already states the role: `stores/auth.ts`, not `auth.store.ts`.

## Barrels

| Folder | `index.ts`? |
|---|---|
| `types/` | **Required** — re-export shared domain types |
| `stores/`, `hooks/` | Optional; if present, prefer the barrel |
| `api/`, `components/`, `pages/`, `features/` | No by default |

## State

- Server state → TanStack Query (`api/` + feature hooks).
- Client/UI state → Zustand (`stores/`).
- Do not reintroduce Redux or a second HTTP client (axios).
